'''Nether '''is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is obtainable by [[Crafting/Salvaging|crafting]] it or through trading. 

== Appearance ==
Its blade is dark purple in color with a patchy texture over it, possibly showing a reference to Minecraft’s nether portal, hence the name. The guard is white, and the handle is dark gray.

== Trivia ==
*[https://www.roblox.com/users/18586528/profile Chris12902] is the creator of this knife.
*The original name of this knife was "Ultraviolet Knife"
*This knife, along with many other knives are from other Murder games. ''For example: Murder by CloneTrooper1019.''
*The description of this knife is: "Carved in the deepest regions of the galaxy."<ref>[https://www.roblox.com/library/175665281/SKIN-Ultraviolet-Knife Model created by Chris12902]</ref>

